PSPVC — PSP Video Converter
Changelog
=========

v0.4 (C Edition) — 2026
-----------------------
• Complete rewrite of PSPVC in C using GTK+ 3
• Faster startup and improved UI responsiveness
• New Cancel → Close behavior with proper ffmpeg termination
• Auto-generation of THM thumbnails
• Auto-suggested PSP filenames (MAQxxxxx.MP4)
• Updated H.264/AVC encoding profiles
• Added volume adjustment control
• Added desktop launcher (pspvc.desktop)
• Added optional Python Edition (pspvc-python)
• Added pixmap installation and icon support
• Added GPLv2 licensing, INSTALL, LICENSE, COPYING, and CREDITS files
• Improved Autotools build system and packaging layout

v0.3 (Original C Edition)
------------------------------
• Updated ffmpeg and x264 support
• Added freedesktop menu entry
• Added H.264/AVC 480×272 profile
• Simplified conversion parameters
• Added input format validation with error messages
• Added Slovenian and German translations
• Added multi-core support via --threads option

v0.2.1
------
• Reorganized interface option order
• Added About window
• Improved convert window title handling
• Thumbnail selection now respects video duration
• Added Polish translation

v0.2
----
• Updated compatibility with newer GCC versions
• Added estimated time display
• Added thumbnail selection feature

v0.1.3
------
• Fixed audio desynchronization for 25 fps sources
• Added Italian translation

v0.1.2
------
• Updated maximum video and audio bitrates
• Removed duplicate audio bitrate parameter for MPEG4/SP
• Fixed queue duplication bug
• Improved 2-pass log filename handling
• Fixed buffer overflow in title field

v0.1.1a
-------
• Added French translation
